cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If this repository helps you, you may cite it as below. It is an informal,
  work-in-progress synthesis of published research, written with Claude, an AI
  assistant by Anthropic. It is not an official standard, not peer-reviewed,
  and not a new result.
title: "reader-ergonomics-family (work in progress)"
abstract: >-
  The front page of the reader-ergonomics family: the standard, its extensions, the topic they build on and the two members that lead out of it, with each member's state and the rules they share. The rules are written out, and two programs audit the members and keep the map true.
type: software
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-11-04
authors:
